e.\nSindon \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere sume gesceafta \u00fee tyma\u00f0 buton h\u00e6mede. and bi\u00f0 \u00e6g\u00f0er ge seo moder m\u00e6den.\nHi tyma\u00f0 heora team mid cl\u00e6nnysse;\nOf \u00f0am hunige hi breda\u00f0 heora brod. and beo\u00f0 acennede \u00fea geongan mid m\u00e6g\u00f0hade. and \u00f0a yldran\nEac seo halige godes gela\u00f0ung \u00fe\u00e6t is eal cristen folc is genemned to anum m\u00e6dene. swa swa se\nIc beweddode eow anum were. \u00fe\u00e6t ge sceoldon gearcian cl\u00e6ne m\u00e6den criste;\nEac IOHANNES se fulluhtere \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0 be criste;\nSe \u00f0e bryde h\u00e6f\u00f0. he is brydguma;\nAnd se sealmwyrhta Dauid sang be criste \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende;\nSwa swa brydguma he g\u00e6\u00f0 for\u00f0 of his brydbedde;\nEalle cyrcan on middanearde sind getealde to anre cyrcan. and seo is gehaten godes gela\u00f0ung. for \u00f0an\nNu is \u00f0eos gela\u00f0ung cristes bryd. and \u00feurhwuna\u00f0 m\u00e6den swa swa seo halige Maria;\nSeo gela\u00f0ung is ealra cristenra manna moder. on gastlicere acennednysse. swa swa crist sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0\nButon gehwa beo tuwa acenned. ne m\u00e6g he na faran into heofonan rice;\nHu bi\u00f0 se mann tuwa acenned? \u00e6lc man bi\u00f0 acenned lichamlice of f\u00e6der and of meder. ac he ne bi\u00f0\nButon gehwa beo geedcenned of w\u00e6tere and of \u00f0an halgan gaste. ne m\u00e6g he faran into godes rice;\n\u00c6lc man bi\u00f0 mid synnum gestryned and geboren \u00f0urh adames forg\u00e6gednysse. ac he bi\u00f0 eft criste\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ter a\u00f0weh\u00f0 \u00feone lichaman. and se halga gast a\u00f0weh\u00f0 \u00f0a sawle fram eallum synnum. and se\nUre ealda f\u00e6der adam us gestrynde to dea\u00f0e. and crist us gestryn\u00f0 gastlice to \u00f0an ecan life. gif we\nEalle \u00f0a \u00f0ing \u00f0e crist dyde for us. ealle hi w\u00e6ron \u00e6r gefyrn gewitegode. \u00fe\u00e6t men sceoldon gelyfan\nSe \u00e6lmihtiga god behet gefyrn worulde Abrahame \u00feam heahf\u00e6dere \u00fe\u00e6t on his cynne sceolde beon\nOf abrahames cynne com se m\u00e6ra cyning Dauid. and of \u00f0am cynecynne com seo halige maria. and\nEft se witega hieremias cw\u00e6\u00f0 be \u00f0am h\u00e6lende \u00f0es is ure god. and nis nan o\u00f0er geteald to him. he\nHe w\u00e6s si\u00f0\u00f0an gesewen ofer eor\u00f0an. and mid mannum he drohtnode;\nEft o\u00f0er witega micheas witegode be cristes tocyme. \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende;\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 sib on eor\u00f0an \u00feonne ure drihten cym\u00f0 to urum lande. and \u00f0onne he g\u00e6\u00f0 into urum husum;\nEft Isaias se witega awrat on his witegunge and \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nEfne an m\u00e6den sceal geacnian. and acennan sunu. and his nama bi\u00f0 emmanuhel \u00fe\u00e6t is gereht god is\nEft Ezechiel witegode be \u00f0\u00e6re byrig Hierusalem. and be criste \u00f0us cwe\u00f0ende;\n\u00dein cyning cym\u00f0 to \u00f0e eadmod. and geedsta\u00f0ela\u00f0 \u00fee;\nDanihel se witega sette eac on his witegunge. \u00fe\u00e6t se heahengel Gabrihel him com to fleogende. and\nIc eom cumen to \u00f0e danihel to \u00f0i. \u00fe\u00e6t ic sceal \u00f0e t\u00e6can. and \u00feu understand mine spr\u00e6ce. and\nFeower hund geara and hundnigontig geara sind getealde of \u00f0ysum d\u00e6ge ofer \u00f0e. and ofer \u00f0inum\nEalle \u00f0as \u00f0ing sind gefyllede \u00feurh cristes menniscnysse. \u00e6fter \u00feam fyrste and andagan \u00fee se\n\u00deurh crist is geendod adames forg\u00e6gednys. and his synn. and crist adylegode \u00e6lce unrihtwisnysse.\nHu is he gesmyrod? Man smyra\u00f0 cyning mid gehalgodum ele. \u00feonne man hine to cyninge gehalga\u00f0.\nCrist is so\u00f0lice ealra biscopa biscop. and ealra cyninga cyning. nu is he gesmyrod na mid eor\u00f0licum\nEft be cristes acennednysse. dauid se sealmwyrhta sang. and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he gehyrde cristes stemne\nGod cw\u00e6\u00f0 to me. \u00f0u eart min sunu nu tod\u00e6g ic gestrynde \u00fee;\nEft \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6der stemn be his 